    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Fear of Crabs"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, fear, mental)\n\nIf a berberoka sees a crab or crab-like creature, the berberoka must attempt a 33 Will save. They then becomes immune to the sight of that creature for 10 minutes.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The berberoka is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The berberoka becomes frightened 2.\n- **Failure:** The berberoka gains the fleeing condition for 1 round and is frightened 4."
            },
            "id": "850a6e40-786d-434d-94ea-df17eb5b424e",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:16.106207"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Deep Breath"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A berberoka can hold their breath for 2 hours."
            },
            "id": "e17905f4-fded-44c6-adf4-b70ddbcad499",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:16.106207"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Consume Lake"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe berberoka drinks a prolific amount from an adjacent water source. If the water source is equal to or greater in volume than themself, the berberoka consumes up to 1,500 gallons of water per minute and becomes waterlogged. They can release water at the same rate.\n\nWhile waterlogged, the berberoka can use Spray Water, their size grows to Gargantuan, and their Speed is reduced to 15 feet."
            },
            "id": "0babbcd6-e512-4a00-87f6-80a1d98e0bd3",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-29T00:33:16.106207"
            }
          }
        }
